'''Twilight Arrow Poison''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Arrow Poison]] that is an {{Odds|occasional}} drop from the [[Voidgloom Seraph]] {{SlayerTier|2}} and above.

== Obtaining ==
'''Twilight Arrow Poison''' is an {{O|occasional}} drop from {{Stier|2}}+ [[Voidgloom Seraph]]s.

;Drop Chances / Amounts
* {{Stier|2}}: 15.15% (16x)
* {{Stier|3}}: 13.41% (24-32x)
* {{Stier|4}}: 12.7% (60-64x)

== Usage ==
Arrows apply a {{Purple|Poison}} that increases all incoming damage by {{Red|10%}} for {{Green|20s}}. The item is consumed on arrow shot.

== Trivia ==
* This is one of the only 2 items labeled "Arrow Poison", the other being [[Toxic Arrow Poison]].

